----                              161  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------  ; [section code]
----                              162  ; Native tokenizer VM interpreter.  ; [section code]
----                              163  ;  ; [section code]
----                              164  ; This interpreter executes the tokenizer bytecode against one line-buffer-backed  ; [section code]
----                              165  ; input stream. Its control flow mirrors the Rust tokenizer VM loop in  ; [section code]
----                              166  ; crates/opforge-vm/src/runtime_model_core.rs:  ; [section code]
----                              167  ; - validate arguments and stream constraints  ; [section code]
----                              168  ; - keep source cursor in D2 and program counter in A0  ; [section code]
----                              169  ; - decode opcodes from the bytecode stream in A3..A3+D7  ; [section code]
----                              170  ; - dispatch scan/predicate helpers that mirror tokenizer_runtime_utils.rs  ; [section code]
----                              171  ; - emit compact native token records into the caller-provided token buffer  ; [section code]
----                              172  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------  ; [section code]
