----                              792  tokvmScanIdentifierDone  ; [section code]
----                              793          ; Match vm_scan_identifier_token(): a trailing prime belongs to the  ; [section code]
----                              794          ; identifier/register lexeme for Z80 alternate-register spellings like AF'.  ; [section code]
