----                              807  tokvmScanIdentifierCommit  ; [section code]
----                              808          ; Identifier spans are half-open in cursor space and become 1-based only  ; [section code]
----                              809          ; when tokvmCommitPendingToken serializes them into the native record.  ; [section code]
